OL,3,GNEWSABikers gather at care home to
OL,4,Agrant resident's wish
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 scooter and motorbike
OL,7,Friders answered a care home's appeal to
OL,8,Fhelp fulfil the wish of a resident
OL,9,Fliving with dementia to be reunited
OL,10,Fwith the mod community he loves.
OL,12,FMeadow Croft care home in Garstang,
OL,13,FLancashire, issued a public appeal
OL,14,Fafter staff learned the resident wanted
OL,15,Fto relive memories of being part of the
OL,16,Fmod and biking community.
OL,18,FIn a post shared online, the home asked
OL,19,Fpeople to help fill its car park with
OL,20,Fscooters and motorbikes so he could
OL,21,Fonce again be "surrounded by mods,
OL,22,Fscooters and bikes".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
