OL,3,GNEWSABikers gather at care home to
OL,4,Agrant resident's wish
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe home's lifestyle manager, Jessica
OL,7,FRichardson, told BBC Radio Lancashire
OL,8,Fshe was "so stunned and overwhelmed" by
OL,9,Fthe turnout.
